ind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest, halfway: five languages, a four-hour stream, five keys to win","summary":"Three days into Steam Next Fest. Thanks to everyone who landed in the fog this week. Here is where things stand. Five interface languages. The demo now plays in English, Simplified Chinese, Spanish, Portuguese (Brazil) and Russian. Switch in Options. The store page is in those languages too. Spotted a wrong word? Tell me in the discussions, the tables get fixes before launch. A four-hour session to watch. RonEmpire played the full game from planetfall through the campaign: Colonize an Alien Plan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:39:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031588","verified_at":"2026-10-22T12:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071520-1846651706694902","game_id":"steam-5071520","kind":"announcement","title":"Free demo in Steam Next Fest, until 26 Oct","summary":"Xenobiome Command is in Steam Next Fest this week. The free demo has the tutorial and the first six campaign maps, from planetfall to the flooded shelf. Demo saves carry into the full game. You land in the fog with one colonist. The purple fungus breeds alien packs, and they walk toward your Landing Zone. Explore the fog, claim ground area by area, keep the colony fed, and burn the fungus before the packs reach you. A map takes 10 to 30 minutes and saves when you quit.Mouse and keyboard, gamepad","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:44:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694902","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:25:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071520-1844751498233150","game_id":"steam-5071520","kind":"announcement","title":"The Steam demo is out","summary":"What you're getting intoYour lander is down in the fog with one colonist and nobody coming to help. The purple fungus on the ground is alive, and it breeds alien packs that walk toward your landing site and take whatever they reach. If they take the landing site, the colony is lost. So you explore the fog, claim the ground under it, and send your wardens out to meet the packs before they arrive. Burn the fungus and it stops breeding. Each map is a new colony to hold, 15 to 30 minutes, from plane","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T05:03:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233150","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:25:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071520-1844115010499063","game_id":"steam-5071520","kind":"announcement","title":"Nineteen months of Xenobiome, in six screenshots","summary":"Nineteen months of Xenobiome, in six screenshotsXenobiome Command started as coloured outlines on a black screen. It's a colony game about holding ground on a feral infested fungal world, and none of that was visible in the first build. Here's what the last nineteen months actually looked like.Evolution of the main menu:2025.01.30 - the first build that actually ranYou could survey an area, claim it, build on it, and lose the colony. That was the whole game. The map was outlines with numbers in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T15:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499063","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:25:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071520-1844115010497025","game_id":"steam-5071520","kind":"announcement","title":"Free browser demo out now.","summary":"The first six campaign maps, playable in your browser, nothing to install: play.xenobiome.netSend the feedback form from the menu and you're in a draw for 5 full-game keys: rulesThe Steam demo arrives 19 October for Next Fest. Wishlist to get pinged.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T11:42:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497025","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:25:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5071520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5071520":"2026-10-26T07:59:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5071520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:18Z"},"5083380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:18Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5071520","app_id":5071520,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:23Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"000e3dbcfbe017f0b03d688e4d8dd2146132ad1d0c3e37ec25b0d3da1b7868c5","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Build a colony on a fungal alien world and keep it alive. Explore the fog, expand across the map, exploit the land, and exterminate the alien packs before they reach your people. Xenobiome Command goes hard - from planetfall to last stand.","publishers":[{"name":"Haroldware Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Haroldware Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793779200,"is_coming_so